                                "sense_id": "23c1f37e-96bd-34ab-925a-90b8db549873",
                                "text": "A boulder ground into Joe's thigh and he yelled for what seemed an eternity in the perishing heat but, apart from a few bird calls, the horse's laboured breath was the only sound he heard."
